<title>THAILAND: Thai stock market closed for mid-year holiday.</title>
<headline>Thai stock market closed for mid-year holiday.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1997-07-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Stock Exchange of Thailand was closed on Tuesday for a mid-year holiday.</p>
<p>The composite SET index closed down 0.90 points at 527.28 on 3.46 billion baht turnover on Monday. The SET-50 index eased 0.21 to 38.20.</p>
<p>The market will reopen on Wednesday.</p>
</text>
